<title>HONG KONG: TMCC mandates $1.0 bln Euro-Asian bond.</title>
<headline>TMCC mandates $1.0 bln Euro-Asian bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp unit Toyota Motor Credit Corp has mandated Credit Suisse First Boston and Merrill Lynch to launch a 10-year Euro-Asian transaction, Merrill Lynch said on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue will be US$1.0 billion in size.</p>
<p>The payment date will be on June 11, 1997, to coincide with the maturing US$1.0 billion TMCC 6.875 percent transaction.</p>
<p>Formal launch is expected at the London open, Merrill Lynch said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
